sequenceDiagram
    actor User as "Retailer/Sales/Manager/Admin/Operator"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant App as "applicationService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    User->>UI: Select order
    UI->>+API: GET /api/v1/orders/{id} and /timeline
    API->>App: Authorize resource scope
    App->>+DB: Read order, allocation trace and status history
    alt Authorized
        DB-->>-App: Order snapshots and transitions
        App-->>UI: Items, prices, fulfillment and timeline
    else Outside scope
        API-->>-UI: 403/404
    end
    Note over UI,DB: Timeline includes PendingApproval, AwaitingAllocation, Allocating, AwaitingRunApproval, Allocated, Picking, Dispatched, Delivering, Delivered and exception branches.


